iptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":841},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":890},{"title":"Ask for Approval actions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/build-workflows/ask-approval-flow-designer.md","line":1419},{"title":"Wait For Message action","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/build-workflows/wait-for-message-action.md","line":1628},{"title":"Wait For Message action","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/build-workflows/wait-for-message-action.md","line":1629},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":1707},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":1755},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":1792},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":1850},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":1888},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":1941},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":1974},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":1975}],"metadata":{"title":"FlowAPI - Scoped, Global","description":"The FlowAPI provides methods to execute actions, flows, or subflows in server-side scripts using either blocking or non-blocking methods.Cancels a paused or running flow, subflow, or action.Runs an action from a server-side script synchronously.Run an action from a server-side script synchronously from the current user session without creating execution details or other related records. Improve performance by eliminating record-keeping overhead. Use this API to increase the speed of high-volume processing, for example multiple executions per second, in a production environment.Runs a Data Stream action synchronously from a server-side script and returns a ScriptableDataStream object.Runs a flow from a server-side script synchronously.Runs a flow, subflow, action, or Data Stream action from a server-side script synchronously or asynchronously without creating execution details or other related records. Improves performance by eliminating record-keeping overhead. Use this API to increase the speed of high-volume processing, for example multiple executions per second, in a production environment.Runs an subflow from a server-side script synchronously.Run a subflow from a server-side script synchronously from the current user session without creating execution details or other related records. Improve performance by eliminating record-keeping overhead. Use this API to increase the speed of high-volume processing, for example multiple executions per second, in a production environment.Returns the error messages produced by a flow, subflow, or action. This method cannot return messages from flows, subflows, or actions run with the quick\\(\\) API.Return a JSON string containing the list of flow stages.Returns the outputs of a completed action or subflow.Returns a ScriptableFlowRunner builder object for a flow or action that you want to run.Returns the status of a flow, subflow, or action.Checks if a flow within a give scope contains any Ask for Approval actions.Restarts a flow, subflow, or action that was run in the background. You can provide new inputs or omit them to reuse the previously provided inputs.Schedule a system event in the Flow Engine Queue to cancel a flow that is in the in progress, presumed interrupted, or waiting state after a delay.Send a specific message and payload response to a flow that is paused and waiting for a message.Builds password2 values inside a script step.Runs an action from a server-side script asynchronously.Runs an action from a server-side script asynchronously without creating execution details or other related records. Improve performance by eliminating record-keeping overhead. Use this API to increase the speed of high-volume processing, for example multiple executions per second, in a production environment.Runs a flow from a server-side script.Runs a flow from a server-side script asynchronously without creating execution details or other related records. Improve performance by eliminating record-keeping overhead. Use this API to increase the speed of high-volume processing, for example multiple executions per second, in a production environment.Runs a subflow from a server-side script.Runs a subflow from a server-side script asynchronously without creating execution details or other related records. Improve performance by eliminating record-keeping overhead. Use this API to increase the speed of high-volume processing, for example multiple executions per second, in a production environment.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":45,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[81,116],[120,128],[152,174],[248,270],[339,373],[398,414],[449,468],[493,512],[547,569],[585,607],[611,645],[661,680],[686,833],[853,878],[894,926],[964,982],[1000,1021],[1039,1048],[1063,1072],[1093,1114],[1136,1170],[1204,1250],[1278,1305],[1334,1361],[1366,1387],[1391,1413],[1447,1460],[1477,1507],[1568,1593],[1597,1605],[1609,1620],[1638,1653],[1659,1670],[1688,1699],[1722,1736],[1766,1784],[1807,1827],[1861,1880],[1903,1918],[1952,1970]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowAPI.md"},
